From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bhargav <BJP232004@GMAIL.COM>
Date: Mon, 6 Jul 2026 13:07:29 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] feat(openobserve): OpenObserve intake endpoint

- new init options: apiVersion (default 'v1'), organizationIdentifier
  (default 'default'), insecureHTTP
- intake path is /rum/{apiVersion}/{organizationIdentifier}/{trackType}
  instead of /api/v2/{trackType}
- the configured site is used verbatim as the intake host (no
  browser-intake-* domain construction, no subdomain prefix)
- Datadog site validation removed
- OpenObserve-specific options are excluded from telemetry serialization

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
